# ==========================
# Regenerable data & model artifacts
# ==========================
# data/raw/*.csv is deliberately NOT ignored: every recorded result splits
# those exact bytes by position, and the production model can only be rebuilt
# exactly from them (a re-fetch can return slightly different bars).

# Trained model binaries -- regenerate via scripts/train_xauusd_model.py.
# metadata.json and scaler.json stay tracked: small, human-readable, and
# the actual reviewable record of what each persisted model is.
models/*/model.joblib
# Generated dashboard (rebuild with scripts/build_dashboard.py)
reports/dashboard.html
